# Project Context — AML Automation

## What the project does

AI-DLC pipeline that reads Excel (.xlsx) or .docx test case documents and generates Playwright tests. Targets the AML application at `https://kadelamldev.customerxps.com:2506`. **Login is currently bypassed** (do not require `EMAIL` / `PASSWORD` until the user asks to enable auth).

## Tech stack

| Item | Version |
|------|---------|
| Playwright | ^1.60.0 |
| mammoth | ^1.8.0 |
| tsx | ^4.19.0 |
| dotenv | ^17.2.3 |
| allure-js-commons | ^3.x |
| allure-commandline | ^2.x |

