## Key flows

- **Report (Allure + Excel):** `npm run pipeline:report`
- **Allure only:** `npm run pipeline:report:allure`
- **Run tests:** `npx playwright test` or `npm run pw:run`
- **List milestones:** `npm run milestone:list`
- **Run one milestone:** `npm run milestone:run -- 2` (or `milestone2`) — auto-discovers `tests/milestoneN/`; defaults to **headed**, **1 worker**, full suite; uses one **persistent Chromium (CDP)** so the same window stays open across Playwright worker restarts after failures. Override: `PW_HEADLESS=1`, `PW_MILESTONE_WORKERS=<n>`, `PW_PERSISTENT_BROWSER=0`
- **Run a module path:** `npm run milestone:run -- 2 tests/milestone2/test-cases/ConfigurationModule/`
- **Run all milestones:** `npm run milestone:all:run`
- **Generate module defects from an execution report:** `npm run qa:generate-defects -- --execution <report.json> --milestone <N>` (plain-language narratives + Feature inference; strips FSD requirement IDs from titles/steps via `plainLanguageNarrative`; mechanical gate `validate-defect-plain-language.cjs` must pass incl. `FSD_TRACEABILITY_PATTERNS`). Validate manually: `npm run qa:validate-defect-plain-language -- results/qa-pipeline/defects/milestone-<N>-defect-rows.json`. See `.cursor/rules/defect-plain-language-mandatory.mdc`.
- **Execute a spec and raise defects (preferred):** `npm run qa:run-module -- --spec <path>` — defaults: **headed**, **1 worker**, **persistent CDP Chromium** (same window after failures; browser closes only when run completes). Alias `qa:execute-raise-defects`. Always writes local defects + execute-raise DOCX; **removes passed TC IDs** from local Excel on regenerate. Google sync after **Approve defects**: `npm run qa:approve-defects-sync`.
- **Run a module via milestone runner:** `npm run milestone:run -- 2 tests/milestone2/...` — also auto-finalizes local defects + DOCX via pipeline reporter.
- **Shared Google Sheet defect sync (after local review approval):** `npm run tracker:cdp-chrome` then `npm run qa:sync-defects-sheet -- --rows results/qa-pipeline/defects/milestone-<N>-defect-rows.json --approved`. **Upsert + stale-module prune by default** (drops passed TCs for synced module on Google). Rewrites Defects tab **contiguously**. Preserves existing **Status** (never regress to New) and existing **Severity/Priority** when already set. `--no-upsert` skips stale prune; `--metadata-only` skips Status, Severity, and Priority. See `.cursor/rules/defect-google-sheet-sync.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/defect-pipeline-doc-sync.mdc`.
- **Defect regression (Google only):** `npm run tracker:cdp-chrome` then `npm run qa:defect-regression -- --milestone <N>`. Reads/writes **Status only on the shared Google Defects tab** for **Resolved** defects. Never updates Severity/Priority. Local Excel is not used. See `.cursor/rules/defect-status-guardrails.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/defect-pipeline-doc-sync.mdc`.

