## MCP (Planner / Generator / Healer)

Project MCP is configured in `.cursor/mcp.json` using Playwright's built-in test server:

```
npx playwright run-test-mcp-server --headless -c .
```

This exposes `planner_*`, `generator_*`, `test_*`, and `browser_*` tools required by agents in `.cursor/agents/`.
**Default is headless** so live exploration / scripting does not open visible browser windows. QA pipeline auto-execute defaults to headless (`PW_HEADLESS=1`; set `PW_HEADLESS=0` to override).

After changing MCP config, restart MCP servers in Cursor (Settings → MCP → reload). Disable any global `@playwright/mcp` server to avoid tool conflicts — the test MCP server includes all browser tools.

